    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d471">

                <pb facs="0662" n="568" sameAs="frus:frus1896/pg568"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Knight to Mr. Olney.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Pretoria</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1896-01-25"><hi rendition="#italic">January 25,
                        1896</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>Hammond still in prison. Bail refused. His present treatment satisfactory. All
                    other arrested American citizens out of prison on $10,000 bail each, but
                    compelled to remain in Pretoria. Trial not before 21 April. All the property
                    shares and bank accounts of the arrested Americans have been attached by
                    Government.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Knight.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
